["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/providesSupportFor", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Agent provides support for each `to` Artifact. The use of the `providesSupportFor` type is constrained to `SupportRelationship` classed relationships.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:N2f890c3397574cda9784008493ad568d", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#IRI", "globalId", "", ""]
